  "brief": "Typology: storage\n\nback_panel: Full matching painted 8 mm MR-MDF enclosed back panel  [system default]\nenvelope.depth: 60 cm for flanking side towers, 45 cm for central base unit, 35 cm for upper open cubbies and overhead cupboards  [system default]\nenvelope.height: 220 cm overall floor-to-top (8 cm plinth + 78 cm base carcass + 128 cm upper assembly + 6 cm cornice = 220 cm)  [system default]\nenvelope.width: 320 cm overall (60 cm left tower, 200 cm central section [45 cm door + 110 cm drawer bank + 45 cm door], 60 cm right tower)  [system default]\nfronts: Left & right towers: top door, open display niche, bottom door. Centre base: single door, 2x3 drawer bank, single door. Centre upper: twin 3x3 open cubby grids, central 2-door cabinet, overhead top doors\nhardware: Modern linear metal bar handles mounted horizontally on drawers and vertically on doors\nlayout: Freestanding breakfront wall unit with projecting flanking towers\nmaterials.carcass: 18 mm moisture-resistant furniture-grade MDF  [system default]\nmaterials.doors: Painted solid timber and MR-MDF panels\nmaterials.finish: Warm off-white / soft greige satin spray lacquer\nplinth: 8 cm continuous plinth with decorative corner plinth blocks  [system default]\nshelves: Fixed vertical/horizontal dividers for the open cubby grids; 1 adjustable shelf per enclosed door compartment  [system default]\nsides: Finished exposed end panels  [system default]\ntop: 6 cm overhanging moulded classical cornice",
